{"id":10339,"bangumiId":10339,"type":2,"name":"青の祓魔師","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-04-17","year":"2011","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg"},"summary":"青之驱魔师所写的世界由两个空间组成，并像镜般连为一体。人类居住的物质界为本作舞台，另外还有恶魔居住的虚无界。平常基本上无法接触或穿梭于两界之间。可是恶魔能凭依于相当的物质从而进入人类的世界。撒旦乃众魔之神，为了从人间捡回一个能抑制他的箱子，而诞下了奥村磷——他跟一人界女子的儿子。可是撒旦的密谋未能得到到磷的认同。及后撒旦更杀掉了磷的监护人养父，并要带磷返去虚无界。这使磷开始了驱魔师之旅，就为了打败他的生父撒旦。","rating":{"rank":2345,"total":7011,"count":{"1":17,"2":17,"3":37,"4":117,"5":435,"6":1470,"7":2480,"8":1734,"9":378,"10":326},"score":7.1},"collection":{"on_hold":815,"dropped":538,"wish":1905,"collect":9531,"doing":2003},"tags":[{"name":"青の祓魔師","count":1557,"total_count":1780},{"name":"兄弟","count":977,"total_count":1685},{"name":"热血","count":883,"total_count":220599},{"name":"2011年4月","count":762,"total_count":24056},{"name":"福山潤","count":631,"total_count":5255},{"name":"JUMP","count":563,"total_count":33939},{"name":"TV","count":457,"total_count":1456001},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":433,"total_count":30225},{"name":"花澤香菜","count":357,"total_count":6990},{"name":"恶魔","count":307,"total_count":1013},{"name":"2011","count":292,"total_count":54228},{"name":"冈本信彦","count":284,"total_count":1409},{"name":"尼桑","count":239,"total_count":243},{"name":"战斗","count":238,"total_count":495175},{"name":"漫画改","count":235,"total_count":898673},{"name":"A-1Pictures","count":227,"total_count":148841},{"name":"蓝色驱魔师","count":181,"total_count":183},{"name":"2011四月番","count":167,"total_count":320},{"name":"奇幻","count":158,"total_count":497436},{"name":"漫改","count":103,"total_count":372233},{"name":"游佐浩二","count":77,"total_count":527},{"name":"日本","count":49,"total_count":320149},{"name":"青之驱魔